<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Food Price Index rises 1.1 pct in March.</title>
<headline>NZ Food Price Index rises 1.1 pct in March.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Tuesday released the following data for the Food Price Index for March:</p>
<p>    Mar 1997	    Feb 1997		Mar 1996</p>
<p>    +1.1 pct	    +0.2 pct		+0.3 pct</p>
<p>yr-end Mar 1997  yr-end Feb 1997  yr-end Mar 1996</p>
<p>    +3.6 pct	    +2.7 pct		+0.5 pct</p>
<p>Note - The index makes up 18 percent of the consumer price index (CPI).</p>
<p>Food subgroups, percentage change from the same month of the previous year:  </p>
<p>				    Mar 1997	Mar 1996</p>
<p>    Fruit and Vegetables    +7.7 pct	-5.3 pct</p>
<p>    Meat, fish and poultry  +4.4 pct	-2.7 pct</p>
<p>    Grocery food etc	  +3.0 pct	+2.6 pct</p>
<p>    Restaurants		 +1.8 pct	+1.7 pct</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
